  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Expansive Living in Top School Zones | Brand New Home in Browns Bay (Completion Expected Before Christmas)\r\n\r\nZoned for prestigious Rangitoto College and Murrays Bay Intermediate, Lot 3/11 Redwing Street offers an exceptionally spacious and comfortable living experience tailored for modern families. Currently under construction, this stunning new home is expected to be completed before Christmas-the perfect gift for your family to celebrate the holiday season in a brand-new, luxurious space!\r\n\r\nExpansive Interior Living: Features 4 generously sized bedrooms, 2.5 well-appointed bathrooms (including a master suite), and a separate lounge. The open-plan kitchen and dining area seamlessly connect to the outdoor decking, offering abundant space for relaxation and entertainment.\r\n\r\nDouble Garage & Premium Finishes: Complete with a spacious double garage with remote control access, top-quality kitchen appliances, a comprehensive security system, and full insulation for year-round convenience and peace of mind.\r\n\r\nPremier Double School Zone: Located within the highly coveted Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College school zones, providing a seamless path to top-tier education.\r\n\r\nMove In Before Christmas: Currently under construction with completion targeted before Christmas. Secure your dream home today!\r\n\r\nSpace, location, and quality all in one. Contact us today to arrange a site visit or request more information!",
